 7 + 8 = 36 \u2192 36 mod 9 = 0\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Add the results modulo 9\n\nNow, sum the values modulo 9:\n\n$$\n1 + 3 + 6 + 1 + 6 + 3 + 1 + 0 = 21\n$$\n\n$$\n21 \\mod 9 = 3\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Final Answer\n\n$$\n\\boxed{3}\n$$", "close_id": 151668, "open_id": 151667, "eos_id": 151645, "cue_ids": [271, 40, 686, 2936, 13295, 323, 2968, 279, 1590, 4226, 1431, 624, 151668, 271]}